# Benchmark / capacity-harness scratch (numbers are published in docs/PERFORMANCE.md
# from a quiet host; the raw runs + benchstat baselines stay local). `make bench`
# writes bench.txt; the capacity harness writes capacity-N.csv. NOTE: the committed
# assets/capacity-rss.svg is intentionally NOT matched here — keep the ignores
# narrow (no bare *.csv / *.svg, which would trap committed assets).
bench*.txt
old.txt
new.txt
capacity-*.csv
.benchscratch/

